#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel2_3)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpageexplanation.ui:17
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>The KDE Wallet system stores your data in a <span "
"style=\" font-style:italic;\">wallet</span> file on your local hard disk. "
"The data is encrypted using your chosen method: the Blowfish algorithm with "
"your password as the key, or GPG with an encryption key. When a wallet is "
"opened, the wallet manager will launch and display an icon in the system "
"tray. You can use this application to manage all of your wallets. It even "
"permits you to drag-and-drop wallets and their contents, allowing you to "
"easily copy a wallet to a remote system.</p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>Sustav KDE-ova novčanika pohranjuje vaše podatke u datoteku <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">novčanika</span> na lokalnom tvrdom disku. Podaci se šifriraju odabranim načinom: algoritmom Blowfish s vašom lozinkom kao ključem ili GPG-om s ključem za šifriranje. Pri otvaranju novčanika pokrenut će se upravitelj novčanika i prikazati ikona u programskoj traci. Ovom aplikacijom možete upravljati svim svojim novčanicima. Možete čak povlačiti i ispuštati novčanike i njihov sadržaj, čime ih jednostavno kopirate na udaljeni sustav.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_3)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpagegpgkey.ui:24
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>The GPG-based wallet uses a GPG encryption key to "
"securely encrypt data on disk. The key must be available when the wallet is "
"decrypted or your wallet will not be accessible. For example, if you choose "
"a SmartCard-based encryption key, you will be prompted to insert it and "
"enter its associated PIN when attempting to open the wallet. <span style=\" "
"font-weight:600;\">Note:</span> this list contains only &quot;ultimate-"
"level&quot; trusted keys.</p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>Novčanik temeljen na GPG-u sigurno šifrira podatke na disku pomoću GPG ključa za šifriranje. Ključ mora biti dostupan pri dešifriranju novčanika, inače mu nećete moći pristupiti. Primjerice, ako odaberete ključ za šifriranje na pametnoj kartici, pri otvaranju novčanika zatražit će se njezino umetanje i unos pripadajućeg PIN-a. <span style=\" font-weight:600;\">Napomena:</span> ovaj popis sadrži samo ključeve s „najvišom” razinom povjerenja.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpagegpgkey.ui:42
#, kde-format
msgid "Select GPG encryption key:"
msgstr "Odaberite ključ za šifriranje GPG-om:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_2)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpagegpgkey.ui:81
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Unable to locate at least one GPG encryption key. KDE Wallet needs a GPG "
"encryption key to securely store passwords or other sensitive data on disk. "
"If you still want to setup a GPG-based wallet, exit this wizard, create an "
"encryption key and return to this wizard. Otherwise, you can return to the "
"previous page and select Blowfish encryption, which does not require an "
"encryption key."
msgstr "Nije moguće pronaći nijedan ključ za šifriranje GPG-om. KDE-ovu novčaniku potreban je ključ za šifriranje GPG-om kako bi sigurno pohranio lozinke i druge osjetljive podatke na disk. Ako ipak želite postaviti novčanik temeljen na GPG-u, zatvorite ovaj čarobnjak, stvorite ključ za šifriranje i vratite se u čarobnjak. U suprotnom se možete vratiti na prethodnu stranicu i odabrati šifriranje Blowfishom, za koje nije potreban ključ za šifriranje."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel2)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpageintro.ui:30
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Welcome to KWallet, the KDE Wallet System. KWallet allows you to store your "
"passwords and other sensitive information on disk in an encrypted file, "
"preventing unauthorized access. This wizard will help you set up KWallet for "
"the first time."
msgstr "Dobro došli u KWallet, KDE-ov sustav novčanika. KWallet vam omogućuje pohranu lozinki i drugih osjetljivih podataka na disk u šifriranu datoteku, čime sprječava neovlašten pristup. Ovaj će vam čarobnjak pomoći prvi put postaviti KWallet."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, _basic)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpageintro.ui:69
#, kde-format
msgid "&Basic setup (recommended)"
msgstr "&Osnovno postavljanje (preporučeno)"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, _advanced)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpageintro.ui:79
#, kde-format
msgid "&Advanced setup"
msgstr "&Napredno postavljanje"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel1_3)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpageoptions.ui:16
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"KWallet lets you adjust the security of your personal data. While the "
"default settings work for most users, you can modify them if needed. "
"Additional adjustments can be made on the KWallet settings page."
msgstr "KWallet vam omogućuje prilagodbu sigurnosti osobnih podataka. Zadane postavke odgovaraju većini korisnika, ali ih po potrebi možete promijeniti. Dodatne prilagodbe dostupne su na stranici postavki KWalleta."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, _closeIdle)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpageoptions.ui:48
#, kde-format
msgid "Automatically close idle wallets"
msgstr "Automatski zatvori neaktivne novčanike"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, _networkWallet)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpageoptions.ui:55
#, kde-format
msgid "Store network passwords and local passwords in separate wallet files"
msgstr "Pohrani mrežne i lokalne lozinke u zasebne datoteke novčanika"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel3)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpagepassword.ui:16
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Various applications may request access to the KDE wallet to store "
"passwords, web form data, or cookies. To allow this, enable the wallet and "
"set a password. Note that the password <i>cannot</i> be recovered if lost "
"and grants full access to all information stored in the wallet."
msgstr "Razne aplikacije mogu zatražiti pristup KDE-ovu novčaniku radi pohrane lozinki, podataka web-obrazaca ili kolačića. Da biste to omogućili, uključite novčanik i postavite lozinku. Imajte na umu da izgubljenu lozinku <i>nije moguće</i> vratiti te da ona omogućuje puni pristup svim podacima pohranjenima u novčaniku."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, _useWallet)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpagepassword.ui:29
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpagepasswordgpg.ui:30
#, kde-format
msgid "Use the KDE wallet to store sensitive information"
msgstr "Koristi KDE-ov novčanik za pohranu osjetljivih podataka"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel1_3)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpagepassword.ui:88
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpagepasswordgpg.ui:120
#, kde-format
msgid "Enter a new password:"
msgstr "Unesite novu lozinku:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel2_3)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpagepassword.ui:104
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpagepasswordgpg.ui:136
#, kde-format
msgid "Verify password:"
msgstr "Potvrdite lozinku:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel3)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpagepasswordgpg.ui:17
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p>Various applications may request access to the KDE "
"wallet to store passwords, web form data, or cookies. To allow this, enable "
"the wallet and choose an encryption method. </p><p>GPG encryption is more "
"secure, but you must have at least one encryption key configured on your "
"system.</p><p>If you choose the classic format, note that the password <span "
"style=\" font-style:italic;\">cannot</span> be recovered if lost and grants "
"full access to all information stored in the wallet.</p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><head/><body><p>Razne aplikacije mogu zatražiti pristup KDE-ovu novčaniku radi pohrane lozinki, podataka web-obrazaca ili kolačića. Da biste to omogućili, uključite novčanik i odaberite način šifriranja. </p><p>Šifriranje GPG-om sigurnije je, ali na sustavu morate imati konfiguriran barem jedan ključ za šifriranje.</p><p>Ako odaberete klasični format, imajte na umu da izgubljenu lozinku <span style=\" font-style:italic;\">nije moguće</span> vratiti te da ona omogućuje puni pristup svim podacima pohranjenima u novčaniku.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, _groupBox)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpagepasswordgpg.ui:46
#, kde-format
msgid "Encryption type"
msgstr "Vrsta šifriranja"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel)
#: ksecretd/kwalletwizardpagepasswordgpg.ui:82
#, kde-format
msgid "More secure but requires the setup of GPG encryption keys."
msgstr "Sigurnije, ali zahtijeva postavljanje ključeva za šifriranje GPG-om."

